    "id": "thm:uniform-binary-alphabet-rate",
    "kind": "theorem",
    "statement": "For \\(d=2\\), uniformly over \\(n\\ge1\\) and \\(m\\ge0\\),\n\\[\nR_\\epsilon(n,m,2)\\asymp_\\epsilon\\frac1n.\n\\]",
